WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.875
To sum up.

2
00:00:00.875 --> 00:00:04.991
You ran two days of privileged
reads against a fictional tenant,

3
00:00:04.991 --> 00:00:09.496
found a role assigned outside PIM
and an unapproved Tier 0 activation,

4
00:00:09.496 --> 00:00:12.525
and compared the days into
six Tier 0 incidents.

5
00:00:12.525 --> 00:00:17.553
You drafted issues with no names, packaged
and chained both runs, assembled a

6
00:00:17.553 --> 00:00:22.900
period that shows Gate 4 isn't met yet, and
saw an edited package fail verification.

7
00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:24.388
And you've finished the path.

8
00:00:24.388 --> 00:00:28.080
Across eight modules you listed
every privileged assignment,

9
00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:31.276
checked the emergency accounts
before anything else,

10
00:00:31.276 --> 00:00:35.325
kept Conditional Access and PIM
settings for roles, groups and Azure

11
00:00:35.325 --> 00:00:40.012
resources as reviewed code, reviewed
privileged access, and filed the evidence.

12
00:00:40.012 --> 00:00:45.140
Go back to the learning path, or find
every lab in one place on the Labs page.
